Description: viewer sources: include math.h explicitly
 Four viewer sources call sqrt/fabs/pow without including math.h
 themselves, relying on transitive includes that the V\OS headers do
 not provide.
Author: Numerio <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>
Forwarded: no
Origin: https://github.com/HaikuArchives/BePDF

